{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_013iG8VhR3h46eZfmG9VaBjo", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://tmj.tvgmu.ru/upload/iblock/5c0/t0hhjinv26v0e4a68m29wm5ghq1z27pb.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://projects.tverlib.ru/vibory/tverskoe_zemstvo/petrunkevich_3.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://booksite.ru/fulltext/1/001/007/065/65405.htm\"}, {\"url\": \"https://booksite.ru/fulltext/tot/maf/ree/11.htm\"}, {\"url\": \"https://in.mmmf.msu.ru/archive/Lomonosov_2007/12/RH/Tretyak.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.dissercat.com/content/tverskoe-zemstvo-v-1865-1890-gg\"}, {\"url\": \"https://booksite.ru/fulltext/tur/upa/nov/13.htm\"}, {\"url\": \"https://bigenc.ru/c/zemskaia-meditsina-8d4a8e\"}, {\"url\": \"https://rmbic.tatarstan.ru/file/rmbic/File/z-25-52-КЗД-2026_с_обл.pdf\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-21T00:29:55.099Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "первый съезд тверских земских врачей 1871 открылся", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01QqECVXRAJUW6X4EP2Ko1dB", "content": [{"title": "tmj.tvgmu.ru", "url": "https://tmj.tvgmu.ru/upload/iblock/5c0/t0hhjinv26v0e4a68m29wm5ghq1z27pb.pdf"}, {"title": "petrunkevich 3", "url": "https://projects.tverlib.ru/vibory/tverskoe_zemstvo/petrunkevich_3.pdf"}, {"title": "Медицинские съезды", "url": "https://booksite.ru/fulltext/1/001/007/065/65405.htm"}, {"title": "ТОТЕМСКОЕ УЕЗДНОЕ ЗЕМСТВО: ДЕЛА И ЛЮДИ", "url": "https://booksite.ru/fulltext/tot/maf/ree/11.htm"}, {"title": "in.mmmf.msu.ru", "url": "https://in.mmmf.msu.ru/archive/Lomonosov_2007/12/RH/Tretyak.pdf"}, {"title": "tverskoe zemstvo v 1865 1890 gg", "url": "https://www.dissercat.com/content/tverskoe-zemstvo-v-1865-1890-gg"}, {"title": "ДРУГ ГОРЬКОГО", "url": "https://booksite.ru/fulltext/tur/upa/nov/13.htm"}, {"title": "Земская медицина", "url": "https://bigenc.ru/c/zemskaia-meditsina-8d4a8e"}, {"title": "z 25 52 КЗД 2026 с обл", "url": "https://rmbic.tatarstan.ru/file/rmbic/File/z-25-52-КЗД-2026_с_обл.pdf"}]}, "The search didn't turn up a direct account of the 1871 opening of the first Tver zemstvo doctors' congress. The closest match is a Tver medical journal article, which describes the congresses in general terms. It says the initiator justified them to the provincial zemstvo board by aiming to obtain detailed, practical information on local sanitation. It also reports that all doctors in Tver Province were invited, and that the congresses were planned for every two years, with the goal of developing zemstvo healthcare programs, especially anti-epidemic measures. Обосновывая перед губернской управой необходимость проведения съездов, он утверждал основную их задачу – «получить по возможности подробные и целесообразные сведения о санитарии местности». На съезд были приглашены все врачи Тверской губернии. Было решено проводить съезды раз в 2 года, задача съездов – разработка программ становления земского здравоохранения и, в первую очередь, программ противоэпидемические мероприятий.\n\nThe article doesn't give the 1871 date or the opening details, so I couldn't confirm them. The results also include a Kazan item noting that in 1871 the Kazan provincial zemstvo assembly created a sanitary department. That's a different province, so it doesn't answer the Tver question. For the exact opening date and proceedings, I'd check the Tver medical journal article in full or Tver regional archive or library sources."], "durationSeconds": 5.327390208, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_013iG8VhR3h46eZfmG9VaBjo", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
